cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this software or the data it publishes, please cite it using
  the metadata below. For a specific figure, also cite the original source
  agency named in that figure's manifest.json or the README's "Data &
  sourcing" section (e.g. NCRB, Delhi Traffic Police) -- this repository is
  a compilation, not the primary source.
title: "DelhiCrimeDashboard: Delhi Urban Safety Observatory"
type: software
abstract: >-
  A district-level crime, road-safety, and infrastructure dashboard for
  Delhi, India, with an interactive Leaflet map and manifest-documented,
  checksummed yearly research releases (2016-2024) for programmatic reuse.
authors:
